        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Loksatta\n- People: Ravi Amale, Malik Amber\n- Places: Mumbai, Pune, Nagpur, Ahmednagar, Aurangabad, Delhi, Aurangabad Division, Marathwada region\n- Roles: Senior editor\n- Topics: Marathi daily newspapers\n\nFacts:\n- Malik Amber founded Aurangabad in 1610.\n- Aurangabad completed 400 years in 2010.\n- Aurangabad is the administrative headquarters of the Aurangabad Division, also called the Marathwada region.\n- Aurangabad is titled \"The City of Gates.\"\n- Loksatta is published from Mumbai, Pune, Nagpur, Ahmednagar, Aurangabad, and Delhi.\n- Loksatta is a leading Marathi daily in Mumbai.\n- Ravi Amale is the senior editor of Loksatta.",
